`bench/fetch-testsuites.sh [NAME...]`: shallow and sparse clones at pinned
commits, `work/testsuites/MANIFEST`.

| suite | contents (C files) | license |
|---|---|---|
| llvm | clang `test/C` (150), `Sema` (1195), `Preprocessor` (325), `Lexer` (84), `Parser` (118), `utils/ABITest` | Apache-2.0 + LLVM exception |
| gcc | `gcc.c-torture` (compile 2016, execute 1926), `gcc.dg` (19 792), `c-c++-common` (3436), `gcc.target/aarch64` (9681) | GPL-3.0+ |
| c-testsuite | 220 small programs with expected output | per test |
| llvm-test-suite | `SingleSource` with reference output (2520) | Apache-2.0 + LLVM exception |
| csmith, yarpgen | random program generators (source code) | BSD-2 / Apache-2.0 |
