gives 1561 passed, 54 failures, one vcc crash and 398 skipped; clang
crashes on two more.  The assembly of vcc's output is checked.
Conditional or unknown DejaGNU directives are skipped.  The run suites
remain.

After the fix of void lvalues: 1562 passed, 54 failures, **no vcc
crashes**, the same 398 skipped and two clang crashes.

