**CI follow-up:** the asm fix at `837cc15` now has full x86 compile
evidence: again **1859 passed, no vcc failures/crashes**, 155 filtered and
two known clang crashes.  The Wasm comparison against `2339f69` separates a
real FP constant regression from earlier gaps.  NaN payload/signaling bits
and binary128 constants are fixed and get a new unmarked regression test;
