220 c-testsuite cases.  `--target aarch64` runs the same rig under QEMU.
After the fix of unknown escape sequences chibicc is green among the
clang-valid cases: x86 12 passed/29 filtered, arm64 11/30.
`--suite llvm` covers direct C files in UnitTests and Regression/C:
